// X-macro registry for fox-ai subcommands.
//
// Add a subcommand by including a line:
//   FOX_SUBCMD( name, binary, "description" )
//
// Where:
//   name        — user-facing subcommand typed after `fox ai` (e.g., doctor)
//   binary      — leaf binary on $PATH that fox-ai execvp's to (fox-ai-doctor)
//   description — one-line description shown in `fox ai help`
//
// Empty for Step 2 of the subplan — Step 3 populates the 23 subcommands.
